---
import type { Locale } from '../lib/i18n';
import { localizedPath } from '../lib/i18n';
import { products } from '../lib/demos/travelops-model';
interface Props {
  locale: Locale;
}
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const en = locale === 'en';
const t = (zh: string, english: string) => (en ? english : zh);
---

<article
  data-view-panel="project-travelops"
  data-travel-demo
  data-locale={locale}
  data-title="TravelOps"
  hidden
>
  <h2>TravelOps</h2>
  <p>
    {t(
      '合成資料・瀏覽器循序模擬。沒有真實交易、Row Lock、Redis Queue 或金流，重新載入會重設。',
      'Synthetic data · sequential browser simulation. No real transactions, row locks, Redis queues or payments. Reloading resets it.',
    )}
  </p>
  <p>
    {t(
      '先建立訂單、確認付款及開券，再比較退款與核銷的操作順序。',
      'Create an order, confirm payment and issue tickets, then compare refund and redemption order.',
    )}
  </p>
  <form data-travel-checkout>
    <h3>{t('購票與共用庫存', 'Purchase & shared inventory')}</h3>
    <label>
      {t('票券商品', 'Ticket product')}
      <select name="product">
        {products.map((p) => (
          <option value={p.id}>
            {en ? p.en : p.zh} · NT$ {p.price / 100}
          </option>
        ))}
      </select>
    </label>
    <label>
      {t('數量', 'Quantity')}
      <input
        name="quantity"
        type="number"
        min="1"
        max="20"
        value="1"
        required
      />
    </label>
    <label>
      {t('通路', 'Channel')}
      <select name="channel">
        <option value="online">Online</option>
        <option value="pos">POS</option>
      </select>
    </label>
    <p data-travel-stock></p>
    <button type="submit">{t('建立模擬訂單', 'Create demo order')}</button>
    <button type="button" data-travel-action="last">
      {t('重設為最後一張票', 'Reset to last ticket')}
    </button>
    <button type="button" data-travel-action="reset">
      {t('重設全部', 'Reset all')}
    </button>
  </form>
  <section>
    <h3>{t('付款、開券與使用權益', 'Payment, issuance & entitlements')}</h3>
    <label>
      {t('目前訂單', 'Current order')}
      <select data-travel-order></select>
    </label>
    <dl data-travel-order-state></dl>
    <div class="reader-actions">
      {[
        [
          'pay',
          t('確認付款／重送相同通知', 'Confirm payment / repeat notification'),
        ],
        ['conflict', t('重送不同金額', 'Repeat with conflicting amount')],
        ['issue', t('執行模擬開券', 'Issue demo tickets')],
        ['request', t('申請整筆退款', 'Request full refund')],
        ['approve', t('核准退款', 'Approve refund')],
        ['confirm', t('確認退款結果', 'Confirm refund result')],
      ].map(([action, label]) => (
        <button type="button" data-travel-action={action}>
          {label}
        </button>
      ))}
    </div>
    <p>
      {t(
        '退款申請尚未核准時仍可核銷；核准時重新檢查，進行中禁止核銷。確認退款才撤銷權益、回補庫存。',
        'Redemption remains possible before approval. Approval rechecks used tickets and blocks further use. Confirmation revokes entitlements and restores stock.',
      )}
    </p>
    <ul data-travel-tickets></ul>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h3>{t('營運對帳', 'Operations reconciliation')}</h3>
    <p>
      {t(
        '帳冊金額使用整數分。人工處置只新增原因，不改寫帳冊；未解決的差異在重跑後仍會出現。',
        'Ledger amounts use integer cents. Disposition adds a reason without changing ledger facts. Uncorrected differences remain after rerunning.',
      )}
    </p>
    <div data-travel-ledgers></div>
    <button type="button" data-travel-action="reconcile">
      {t('執行／重跑對帳', 'Run / rerun reconciliation')}
    </button>
    <ul data-travel-differences></ul>
    <form data-travel-resolution>
      <label>
        {t('差異參照', 'Difference reference')}
        <select name="reference">
          <option>DEMO-101</option>
          <option>DEMO-102</option>
          <option>DEMO-103</option>
        </select>
      </label>
      <label>
        {t('處置原因', 'Disposition reason')}
        <input name="reason" required maxlength="200" />
      </label>
      <button type="submit">{t('新增處置紀錄', 'Record disposition')}</button>
    </form>
    <ul data-travel-resolutions></ul>
  </section>
  <p role="status" data-travel-status></p>
  <h3>{t('本次操作紀錄', 'Session events')}</h3>
  <ol data-travel-events></ol>
  <a data-native-case href={localizedPath(locale, 'projects/travelops')}>
    {t(
      '閱讀已審核案例、影片與來源驗證限制',
      'Read the reviewed case, video and source verification limits',
    )}
  </a>
</article>
<style>
  form,
  section {
    margin-block: 1.75rem;
  }
  label {
    display: block;
    margin-block: 0.75rem;
  }
  input,
  select {
    display: block;
    min-height: 44px;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 28rem;
  }
  button {
    min-height: 44px;
    margin: 0.25rem;
    white-space: normal;
  }
  dl {
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  [data-travel-status] {
    position: sticky;
    bottom: 0;
    background: var(--paper, #fff);
    padding: 1rem;
    color: var(--ink, #172d32);
  }
  [data-travel-ledgers] {
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  li {
    margin-block: 0.5rem;
  }
</style>
